-- The opening back bar: 40 drinks, 28 of them alcoholic (70%).
--
-- Pool only. Deliberately no `INSERT INTO drink_schedule` rows, for the same
-- reason no dish migration ever writes to `schedule`: nights are booked by hand
-- in /admin and that booking exists nowhere but prod D1. An unbooked night runs
-- on the deterministic fallback pick and never 404s.
--
-- Keyed by slug throughout, never by id. A drink renamed in /admin regenerates
-- its slug, which is what silently broke seven dishes' backfill migrations in
-- Aug 2026; the failure mode is the same here and so is the rule.
--
-- Three coasters each, written against the coaster sheet in shared/clues.ts and
-- checked by worker/data-integrity.test.ts, which fails CI.


